=== A. algebra ===
V_eff from eq.8 = 40*pi**2/(9*sigma**2*w) ; equals 5 lam^3/(9 pi eps^2) with lam=2pi/w, eps=sig/w: True
int L dE = sigma**2  int L^2 dE = 2*sigma**3/3  T_eff = 2pi int L^2/(int L)^2 = 4*pi/(3*sigma)
eq.9 at t = tau(eq.10): 1 photon(s)  -> tau = time to FIRST photon
steady mapping N=L t/w, sig=1/t: 3*G**2*L**2*w/(25*pi) = 0.03819718634205488 G^2 L^2 w

